content_writer.template:
You are Uplora AI, an expert {content_type} writer.

WRITING PARAMETERS:
- Language: {language}
- Tone: {tone}
- Target Audience: {target_audience}
- Content Length: {length_guide}
- Platform: {platform}
- Focus Keywords (use naturally, never forced): {keywords}

STRICT RULES:
1. Write publication-ready content immediately — no preamble
2. Never include placeholder text
3. Never explain what you're about to write
4. Active voice 80%+
5. No clichés (avoid: 'In today's world', 'In conclusion', 'It goes without saying')
6. Hook must appear in the first sentence
7. Every section must earn its place

facebook_post.user_prompt:
Write a Facebook post about: {topic}

PAGE TYPE: {page_type}
AUDIENCE: {target_audience}
TONE: {tone}
GOAL: {goal}

FORMAT:
- Opening line: Question or bold statement (40-80 chars optimal)
- Body: 2-3 short paragraphs, conversational tone
- End with: Question to drive comments OR clear CTA
- Optional: Poll question if goal is engagement

BEST PERFORMING FORMATS ON FACEBOOK:
1. Story post: Personal story → lesson → question
2. List post: '5 reasons why...' format
3. Timely post: Connect to trending topic
4. Question post: Open-ended question relevant to audience

USE FORMAT: {post_format}

Return ONLY the post text.

email_newsletter.user_prompt:
Write an email newsletter:

BRAND: {brand_name}
TOPIC: {topic}
SUBSCRIBER SEGMENT: {segment}
TONE: {tone}
GOAL: {goal}

REQUIRED SECTIONS (use these EXACT labels):

SUBJECT: [Max 50 chars. Curiosity-driven or benefit-driven. No spam words: free, guaranteed, click here, buy now, limited time, winner]

PREVIEW: [Max 90 chars. Complements subject, adds intrigue, doesn't repeat it]

GREETING: [Warm, personalized tone. Use {{first_name}} placeholder]

INTRO: [2-3 lines. Why this email matters TODAY. Create urgency or relevance]

MAIN CONTENT:
[Core value — 200-400 words. Use subheadings. Scannable format. Short paragraphs]

KEY TAKEAWAY: [1-2 sentences. The ONE thing they should remember]

CTA: [{cta_text} — benefit-focused, action verb, max 5 words]

P.S.: [1 sentence. Often the most-read section. Use for second CTA, bonus tip, or personal note]

ad_copy_social.user_prompt:
Write social media ad copy for {platform}:

PRODUCT/SERVICE: {product}
AUDIENCE: {target_audience}
OBJECTIVE: {objective}
OFFER: {offer}
PSYCHOLOGY TRIGGERS: {psychology_triggers}

Deliver 3 variations:

VARIATION A — STORY ANGLE:
Primary Text (125 chars): [Open with relatable scenario]
Headline (27 chars): [Benefit + value]
Description (27 chars): [Reinforce with urgency]
CTA Button: {cta_button}

VARIATION B — PROBLEM/AGITATE/SOLVE:
Primary Text (125 chars): [Name pain → twist knife → offer solution]
Headline (27 chars): [Solution-focused]
Description (27 chars): [Quantified result]
CTA Button: {cta_button}

VARIATION C — SOCIAL PROOF:
Primary Text (125 chars): ['X people have already...' or customer-voice style]
Headline (27 chars): [Result-focused]
Description (27 chars): [Trust signal]
CTA Button: {cta_button}

VIDEO HOOK SCRIPT (first 3 seconds): [For video ads — make it impossible to scroll past]

CHAR COUNT VERIFICATION: [Verify each element]

content_repurpose.user_prompt:
Transform the following {source_type} into {target_type}.

SOURCE CONTENT:
{source_content}

TARGET FORMAT: {target_type}
TARGET PLATFORM: {target_platform}
TARGET AUDIENCE: {target_audience}
TONE ADJUSTMENT: {tone_shift}

PLATFORM REQUIREMENTS FOR {target_type}:
{platform_requirements}

CONVERSION RULES:
1. Preserve ALL key insights and core message
2. Completely rewrite for the new format — no verbatim copying
3. Adjust depth: condense for short formats, expand for long formats
4. Optimize structure for platform (headers for blog, emojis for social, etc.)
5. The output must feel original and native to {target_platform}

Return ONLY the repurposed content in the target format.

